   "dice": [
    [
     {
      "t": "Each concrete combination is what we call a bundle."
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "t": "With two goods, a bundle is simply a pair of numbers: how much of good one and how much of good two."
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "t": "We write it like this: "
     },
