     {
      "t": "And here is the idea that makes everything else visible."
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "t": "If each good is an axis, then every possible bundle is a point on the plane."
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "t": "The goods space stops being a list of numbers and becomes a map."
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "t": "Let us put coffee in pounds on the horizontal axis, and orange juice in quarts on the vertical one."
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "t": "Coffee costs three dollars a pound, juice costs one a quart, and you have one hundred dollars."
     }
    ]
