   "dice": [
    [
     {
      "t": "The slope is minus p one over p two, that is, minus three."
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "t": "That number is not abstract: it means that to take home one more pound of coffee, you have to give up three quarts of juice."
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "t": "The market lets you transform three quarts of juice into one pound of coffee, at the current prices."
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "t": "That is why the slope is called the relative price."
     }
    ]
   ],
